From b46ba3f967bbca46ef8fef87a44fb3fa8a8000bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kodarai Dev <dev@kodarai.xyz>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 23:45:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Microsoft Clarity (managed in /internal/marketing) and ad
 images on /start

- Clarity project ID stored in marketing_adsense_settings.clarity_project_id
  (SQL: supabase/migrations/20261005120000_add_clarity_project_id.sql) and
  edited in /internal/marketing; accepts the ID or the pasted install code
- Recordings run only on public funnel pages (/, /start, /signup, /login,
  /choose-plan) and are stopped once a visitor enters the app
- Clarity tags: start_variant, start_hook (filter recordings by version/headline)
- /start lean: swipeable 'See it in action' row with the Finder video/poster
  plus ad creatives from public/start/ads (ad-1.jpg included)
- Privacy page no longer claims 'no tracking cookies'; discloses Google
  Analytics, Meta Pixel and Microsoft Clarity
---
